  "pinto": {
   "note": "EP68 the Ford Pinto / Grimshaw v. Ford. USA 1968-1981 (Southern California; Elkhart County and Winamac, Indiana; Ford engineering interiors; Washington DC). Queries are verbatim from episodes/_planning/EP68_pinto_FOOTAGE_PLAN.v001.md s4: 623 queries were measured against the ledger over two rounds, 470 table rows returned at least one unused >=1920x1080 clip, and those are 465 distinct queries -- kept here ordered by register (R1 the car .. R20 dusk) and by measured supply inside each register. Director's words returned zero where supplier's words returned hundreds (PD_CANON s10): `courthouse` 0 / `arch` 468, `grey sky` 0 / `clouds` 500, `crash test` 0 / `hit` 641. A HIT COUNT IS NOT A SUPPLY COUNT, and three of those wins are traps: `hit` is mostly waves on rocks, `arch` is European cathedrals and Asian temples, and this film may show no collision at all. CORRECTED 2026-08-12: the sentence that stood here claimed the 124 forbidden_subjects in episode_spec were applied to candidate titles before staging. NO CODE DID THAT, and 106 of the 807 candidates this query set produced carried a forbidden term as a whole word in their own ledger title (drone 26, burning 14, beach 11, smoke 10, fire 5, police 4). They are applied now, for real, by stage_footage_by_title.forbidden_hit at selection and by prestage_footage_review.filter_forbidden on the candidate list -- check_spec_satisfied matches them word-wise against the staged filename, so a survivor is an automatic build failure after the render. CONSEQUENCE, AND IT NEEDS AN OWNER DECISION: 20 of the 465 queries below ARE forbidden subjects (ash, fire, smoke, burn, burning, flame, crash, bonfire, black smoke, campfire, wreck, candle flame, soot, smoke rising, ember, accident, car crash, wrecked car, smoke slow, hourglass), so assert_queries_clean now REFUSES to run this set until either those queries or the spec change. Do not resolve it by weakening forbidden_subjects. The four registers the archive cannot supply at all (typed paper, the underside of a car, an American courthouse, and 1968-1981 itself) are carried by generated plates R001-R080 and by no query here.",
